45
04:06.402 --> 04:09.811
At least I never broke his heart.

46
04:14.702 --> 04:15.968
If you can't do it,

47
04:16.268 --> 04:17.102
you should step back.

48
04:19.068 --> 04:19.868
Sys.

49
04:28.268 --> 04:29.068
I won't step back.

50
04:35.368 --> 04:36.602
I won't step back either.

51
