102
07:45.463 --> 07:48.241
Whoa, look who're here watching his partner?

103
07:48.800 --> 07:50.063
I'm just keeping an eye on things.

104
07:50.430 --> 07:52.650
You're here to keep an eye on things?

105
07:52.694 --> 07:54.881
Do I need to tuck in my shirt?

106
07:56.069 --> 07:56.811
Wit.

107
07:58.863 --> 08:02.796
Hello, we're Goofy band.

108
08:05.663 --> 08:09.739
May Santa bring joy to everyone today.

109
08:10.197 --> 08:12.342
But I don't have to wait for Santa anymore.

110
08:12.342 --> 08:15.736
Since Nai makes me happy everyday.

111
08:15.736 --> 08:18.176
Thank you, my happiness.

112
08:20.496 --> 08:21.296
Damn.

113
08:22.210 --> 08:23.343
