114
08:23.396 --> 08:24.330
Since when?

115
08:25.196 --> 08:25.996
Dangerous.

116
08:27.030 --> 08:28.230
Wit.

117
08:52.256 --> 08:53.556
If you can't do it,

118
08:53.663 --> 08:54.463
you should step back.

119
08:54.830 --> 08:55.630
I won't step back.

120
09:42.145 --> 09:44.611
Hey, where has Fuse gone?

121
