124
10:11.324 --> 10:12.524
Can we talk?

125
10:14.729 --> 10:15.529
Um.

126
10:19.472 --> 10:21.006
How are you doing?

127
10:23.568 --> 10:24.602
Just the usual.

128
10:29.241 --> 10:30.923
And today…

129
10:30.948 --> 10:31.761
Fuse.

130
10:33.397 --> 10:35.031
Just say it already,

131
10:36.502 --> 10:37.535
