134
10:50.523 --> 10:52.290
Do you want to make it harder for me to move on?

135
10:57.632 --> 11:00.151
I told you I'm not you.

136
11:02.565 --> 11:03.660
Because I love you.

137
11:11.771 --> 11:13.071
Give me some time.

138
11:15.297 --> 11:16.097
Tee.

139
11:29.187 --> 11:30.753
Please don't get over me yet.

140
11:39.489 --> 11:42.407
I know everything ends up like this…

141
11:44.676 --> 11:45.809
