142
11:49.573 --> 11:51.306
But I don't want it to be like this.

143
11:57.353 --> 11:58.887
Can I have a little more time?

144
12:04.309 --> 12:06.076
And I'll never break your heart again.

145
12:12.949 --> 12:13.949
What about Jeen?

146
12:21.476 --> 12:22.609
Everything will be fine.

147
12:29.564 --> 12:30.764
Trust me, please.

148
12:38.821 --> 12:40.155
You did it again.

149
12:45.309 --> 12:47.409
Why do you always make it so hard for me to leave you?

150
13:12.542 --> 13:13.875
I miss you so badly.

151
13:28.198 --> 13:29.465
I miss you so badly too.

152
14:17.959 --> 14:18.759
Thank you.

153
14:19.359 --> 14:20.159
Thank you.

154
14:20.886 --> 14:21.686
Thank you so much.

155
14:23.793 --> 14:25.093
I'm good. You should keep it.

156
14:26.226 --> 14:27.430
Hey.

157
14:27.732 --> 14:28.532
Fuse.

158
14:28.953 --> 14:30.686
Did you land a big client?

159
14:32.105 --> 14:33.239
Now that he's here,

160
14:33.368 --> 14:34.902
I bet he's gonna buy the entire shop.

161
14:34.927 --> 14:35.427
Right.

162
14:35.427 --> 14:35.927
Yeah.

163
14:36.259 --> 14:37.026
Chill out.

164
14:37.026 --> 14:38.618
I've just brought him here for a walk,

165
14:38.711 --> 14:40.052
