166
14:40.193 --> 14:41.516
Come on, you should buy some.

167
14:41.692 --> 14:42.970
Support our shop, please.

168
14:43.026 --> 14:43.826
We're friends.

169
14:44.359 --> 14:45.259
Shirts look nice.

170
14:46.193 --> 14:46.993
Can you choose them for me?

171
14:47.393 --> 14:48.193
I'll take ten of them.

172
14:48.459 --> 14:49.259
Hey.

173
14:49.793 --> 14:50.593
Seriously?

174
14:50.593 --> 14:51.826
I'll pick awesome shirts for you.

175
14:52.493 --> 14:53.836
Wit, help me pick ten of them.

176
14:53.836 --> 14:54.336
You sure?

177
14:54.336 --> 14:55.059
I'll throw some in for free.

178
14:55.101 --> 14:56.268
I'll pick stylish shirts for you.

179
14:56.293 --> 14:57.693
You actually don't have to buy them.

180
14:58.426 --> 14:59.559
Shall we give him one of each color?

181
14:59.693 --> 15:00.393
Good idea.

182
15:00.393 --> 15:01.059
It's okay.

183
15:01.059 --> 15:01.859
I want to buy them.

184
15:03.359 --> 15:04.693
Do you have any freebies?

185
15:14.493 --> 15:16.656
Hey, guys.

186
15:16.693 --> 15:18.259
