187
15:19.425 --> 15:21.259
This is Yok and Kristina.

188
15:23.462 --> 15:24.423
This is my friends.

189
15:25.289 --> 15:27.662
Hey, haven't you guys met before?

190
15:27.775 --> 15:29.709
Why are you keeping introducing?

191
15:30.009 --> 15:30.675
Teacher.

192
15:30.675 --> 15:31.409
What?

193
15:31.509 --> 15:32.975
There is something on your face.

194
15:33.000 --> 15:33.800
Oh.

195
15:33.988 --> 15:36.123
Really? Where? What is it?

196
15:36.777 --> 15:37.884
It's beauty.

197
15:38.137 --> 15:38.637
Oh.

198
15:39.921 --> 15:40.721
I know.

199
15:44.209 --> 15:47.296
But this one is an angel.

200
15:47.975 --> 15:49.213
Boo.

201
15:49.213 --> 15:51.150
Stop it.

202
15:53.997 --> 15:55.296
Wit.

203
15:55.323 --> 15:56.136
Let's talk this out outside, Wit.

204
15:56.163 --> 15:57.212
Let's talk this out outside.

205
15:57.212 --> 15:58.348
We should talk this out outside.

206
16:00.029 --> 16:02.138
Then who will take care of the shop?

207
16:02.163 --> 16:03.553
I'm going to walk over there first.

208
16:04.950 --> 16:05.423
Okay.

209
16:05.783 --> 16:06.489
Bye.

210
16:06.581 --> 16:08.047
Hey, who will take care of the shop?

211
16:09.250 --> 16:10.050
I'll take care of it.

212
16:10.717 --> 16:11.984
Come on, have a seat.

213
16:19.790 --> 16:21.443
Come take a look.

214
16:22.403 --> 16:23.769
Mo, I’ll take these two.

215
16:23.830 --> 16:26.657
Alright, I’ll give you a special price.

216
16:26.657 --> 16:29.703
One hundred for each, so two hundred for two.

217
16:30.483 --> 16:32.249
Special price, my ass.

218
16:33.175 --> 16:34.309
Fine.

219
16:34.550 --> 16:35.603
So you’ll take these two?

220
16:35.643 --> 16:36.210
Yep.

221
16:36.235 --> 16:36.735
Okay.

222
16:37.256 --> 16:38.323
Thank you.

223
16:39.396 --> 16:40.196
Which color do you want?

224
16:40.529 --> 16:41.329
This one?

225
16:42.303 --> 16:43.336
Here you go.

226
16:45.216 --> 16:45.830
How's it?

227
16:48.196 --> 16:49.262
Special promotion.

228
16:55.517 --> 16:56.351
Oh, Mo.

229
16:56.917 --> 16:58.251
Namtan.

230
16:59.317 --> 17:01.082
I knew I'd run into you.

231
17:01.343 --> 17:03.670
I haven't seen you lately.

232
17:03.900 --> 17:05.717
All I see are your park aerobics photos.

233
17:05.831 --> 17:07.996
Hey, it's fun. You should try it.

234
17:08.851 --> 17:09.951
Can I tag along with you then?

235
17:10.062 --> 17:12.495
Cool, we can go there together.

236
17:13.642 --> 17:15.185
Who do you normally go with?

237
17:15.398 --> 17:16.556
Well…

238
17:18.017 --> 17:18.817
I go there with my friend.

239
17:21.184 --> 17:22.517
Which one do you want?

240
17:24.551 --> 17:26.151
I'll buy some water.

241
17:28.151 --> 17:28.951
Yok.

242
17:32.217 --> 17:34.443
Hey, this one looks great.

243
17:34.748 --> 17:35.856
How much is it?

244
17:36.451 --> 17:38.151
I'm sorry, the shop is closed now.

245
17:48.984 --> 17:50.450
Who do you normally go with?

246
17:50.591 --> 17:51.676
Well…

247
17:53.257 --> 17:54.057
I go there with my friend.

248
17:56.429 --> 17:57.363
Which one do you want?

249
18:05.917 --> 18:07.651
Tee, didn't you buy too much?

250
18:08.710 --> 18:09.917
Everything looks so delicious.

251
18:12.017 --> 18:14.251
Here, try this one.

252
18:15.737 --> 18:17.637
Oh, it looks so sweet.

253
18:18.230 --> 18:19.851
I don’t eat this, so I give it to you.

254
18:21.122 --> 18:22.083
Tee.

255
18:23.317 --> 18:24.651
You're at it again.

256
18:25.617 --> 18:26.417
Oh.

257
18:28.617 --> 18:29.417
Yok.

258
18:33.296 --> 18:34.263
What are you doing here?

259
18:35.363 --> 18:36.330
Where is Lookmo?

260
18:38.203 --> 18:40.670
I just feel like sitting and watching something alone.

261
18:45.470 --> 18:47.203
You can let us know if anything happens.

262
18:48.477 --> 18:49.410
Want some snacks?

263
18:49.435 --> 18:51.435
Tee, this one is too sweet.

264
18:52.281 --> 18:54.509
Then I'll give him something else.

265
18:55.778 --> 18:56.812
Is there something not too sweet?

266
19:00.656 --> 19:03.870
You guys are so handsome. Do you have partners?

267
19:11.776 --> 19:13.243
If you're already talking to someone,

268
19:13.709 --> 19:15.543
you should be clear about your status with them.

269
19:16.017 --> 19:18.551
It's so uncomfortable to be in a situationship.

270
19:30.251 --> 19:33.711
Yeah, being in a situationship is suffocating.

271
19:35.744 --> 19:39.019
Sometimes it's so suffocating I can't even breathe.

272
19:40.442 --> 19:43.802
But I can't walk away either because I already love that person.

273
19:48.417 --> 19:49.951
You know how it feels?

274
19:52.484 --> 19:53.284
I'm surprised.

275
19:54.317 --> 19:56.351
I thought a perfect guy like you…

276
19:57.051 --> 19:58.751
would never have this problem.

277
20:04.884 --> 20:06.617
Love spares no one.

278
20:08.590 --> 20:10.090
The moment we start loving, it already hurts.

279
20:22.251 --> 20:23.051
Yok.

280
20:35.651 --> 20:36.451
Yok.

281
20:37.751 --> 20:38.817
Isn't the event fun?

282
20:43.217 --> 20:45.751
Can you tell me what's wrong?

283
20:47.917 --> 20:49.372
Did you ask me "what's wrong"?

284
20:50.634 --> 20:52.510
I also want to know what's wrong with me.

285
20:58.030 --> 20:59.863
What am I to you?

286
21:06.151 --> 21:06.951
A friend.

287
21:17.851 --> 21:18.978
But…

288
21:20.372 --> 21:22.139
A friend who I don't want to be just a friend anymore.

289
21:29.017 --> 21:29.753
I mean…

290
21:31.176 --> 21:33.485
All the time I've spent with you,

291
21:34.349 --> 21:36.254
I've been so happy.

292
21:42.097 --> 21:43.163
I'm not sure…

293
21:43.429 --> 21:45.163
if you feel the same way.

294
21:46.924 --> 21:47.757
Would it be okay…

295
21:48.417 --> 21:49.743
if I asked you to be my boyfriend?

296
21:49.768 --> 21:50.564
Sure.

297
21:50.619 --> 21:51.119
Huh?

298
21:51.450 --> 21:52.250
I'll be your boyfriend.

299
21:52.817 --> 21:54.126
I haven't asked you yet.

300
21:54.151 --> 21:54.917
It's fine.

301
21:54.917 --> 21:55.717
I can be your boyfriend right now.

302
21:56.283 --> 21:57.626
Let me ask you out first.

303
21:58.189 --> 21:59.623
Hurry up then.

304
22:02.251 --> 22:02.751
Yok.

305
22:04.123 --> 22:05.335
You're the person…

306
22:06.199 --> 22:07.647
who is so adorable.

307
22:08.664 --> 22:11.653
I like you so much.

308
22:13.245 --> 22:16.871
And I like it when we dance aerobics together.

309
22:18.284 --> 22:19.498
Would it be okay…

310
22:20.996 --> 22:23.125
if I ask you to dance aerobics with me…

311
22:23.150 --> 22:25.054
for a long time?

312
22:26.020 --> 22:26.851
Will you be my boyfriend?

313
22:27.351 --> 22:29.517
I will, I will be your boyfriend.

314
22:30.351 --> 22:31.617
I'm taken!

315
23:01.484 --> 23:05.851
I guess painless love does exist.

316
23:27.851 --> 23:29.851
Tee, trust me.

317
23:38.051 --> 23:41.215
Hello? Have you arrived?

318
23:42.384 --> 23:44.178
Okay.

319
23:44.788 --> 23:45.710
Alright.

320
24:01.251 --> 24:03.551
Come with me, please.

321
24:23.217 --> 24:27.451
Please let me explain first.

322
24:30.684 --> 24:32.317
The guy you saw in the picture,

323
24:33.450 --> 24:34.683
he is actually my brother.

324
24:36.010 --> 24:37.576
But the guy you saw on the other day,

325
24:38.809 --> 24:40.109
he is also my brother.

326
24:41.910 --> 24:43.410
My adoptive brother.

327
24:47.990 --> 24:48.823
Hey, Jeen.

328
24:50.351 --> 24:51.151
France.

329
24:53.517 --> 24:55.051
Did you really call your date all the way here?

330
24:55.817 --> 24:57.451
Your brother isn't named Tea anymore?

331
25:02.444 --> 25:03.644
Is that your friend?

332
25:04.590 --> 25:05.990
I mean…

333
25:06.049 --> 25:08.761
Don't tell me you have someone else.

334
25:11.251 --> 25:14.617
If you're gonna be with someone else, at least pick someone better.

335
25:15.084 --> 25:15.884
What did you say?

336
25:18.759 --> 25:20.047
Tee.

337
25:22.088 --> 25:23.117
Chill out.

338
25:23.117 --> 25:23.917
Enough.

339
25:25.837 --> 25:26.803
I think that's enough.

340
25:28.537 --> 25:30.204
France is right.

341
25:31.317 --> 25:32.850
I should have made a better choice.

342
25:36.684 --> 25:38.484
When I first saw you,

343
25:39.684 --> 25:41.317
I thought you were really cool.

344
25:42.717 --> 25:44.051
So I decided to date you.

345
25:47.084 --> 25:49.084
I never thought it would be this boring.

346
25:52.884 --> 25:53.920
Can you believe it?

347
25:54.428 --> 25:55.643
We've been together for a whole year.

348
25:56.355 --> 25:57.501
And nothing has happened between us.

349
25:58.416 --> 26:01.517
When I'm with you, I feel like I'm hanging out with friends.

350
26:03.017 --> 26:04.951
So why would I even have you as a boyfriend?

351
26:07.251 --> 26:08.317
But with France,

352
26:09.251 --> 26:10.751
he can do everything for me.

353
26:12.684 --> 26:14.084
Being with him feels like we're dating.

354
26:16.951 --> 26:18.717
Everything you've never done to me,

355
26:20.351 --> 26:22.051
he can do it all.

356
26:27.951 --> 26:30.484
Why don't you just break up with me?

357
26:33.423 --> 26:35.089
Why don't you just break up with me then?

358
26:37.997 --> 26:41.331
I know that you're not that into me.

359
26:43.704 --> 26:45.604
You're not breaking up with me…

360
26:46.570 --> 26:47.884
because you're afraid of being a bad person, right?

361
26:52.684 --> 26:53.484
Alright.

362
26:54.484 --> 26:55.951
I'll be a bad person instead.

363
26:58.917 --> 26:59.917
Let's break up.

364
27:04.084 --> 27:06.284
So you can find someone you really like.

365
27:10.517 --> 27:11.517
I'm exhausted.

366
27:14.651 --> 27:16.851
I'd rather choose someone who shares my vibes.

367
27:26.551 --> 27:27.351
Hey, France.

368
27:27.951 --> 27:28.884
Are you here too?

369
27:29.284 --> 27:30.084
And…

370
27:30.917 --> 27:31.717
Who is this girl?

371
27:32.417 --> 27:33.251
I'm France's girlfriend.

372
27:33.517 --> 27:34.279
He's my boyfriend.

373
27:34.279 --> 27:35.031
Huh?

374
27:35.056 --> 27:36.626
What do you mean? He's my boyfriend.

375
27:36.651 --> 27:37.151
He's my boyfriend.

376
27:37.151 --> 27:37.972
He's my boyfriend.

377
27:37.972 --> 27:38.472
He's my boyfriend.

378
27:38.497 --> 27:39.292
He's my boyfriend.

379
27:39.317 --> 27:39.817
He's my boyfriend.

380
27:39.846 --> 27:40.853
Baby.

381
27:41.151 --> 27:41.951
Hey.

382
27:41.951 --> 27:43.280
What are you doing with my boyfriend?

383
27:43.280 --> 27:44.186
Get out.

384
27:44.211 --> 27:44.825
Ouch.

385
27:44.851 --> 27:46.292
Hey, get out.

386
27:46.317 --> 27:47.117
Wait.

387
27:47.884 --> 27:48.715
France.

388
27:48.715 --> 27:49.215
Hey.

389
27:49.517 --> 27:50.317
France.

390
27:51.496 --> 27:52.350
What's going on?

391
27:52.375 --> 27:53.856
Hey, stop. Stop it.

392
27:54.497 --> 27:55.897
Why are you fighting right here?

393
27:56.825 --> 27:58.425
You're from other schools, right?

394
27:58.870 --> 28:00.337
Please leave our school right now.

395
28:01.430 --> 28:02.230
Please leave.

396
28:02.663 --> 28:03.463
I said leave.

397
28:03.997 --> 28:05.930
Gosh, these kids.

398
28:08.150 --> 28:10.050
Did you two have a fight with them too?

399
28:10.322 --> 28:11.122
No, we didn't.

400
28:11.669 --> 28:13.969
Head inside then. The activity is about to start.

401
28:14.237 --> 28:15.037
Okay.

402
28:15.470 --> 28:18.437
Seriously, there's drama every single day. What a chaotic school.

403
28:29.390 --> 28:30.356
I'm sorry.

404
28:32.810 --> 28:33.843
Why did you say sorry?

405
28:36.276 --> 28:37.743
I'm sorry that she was the one who said it.

406
28:38.437 --> 28:39.237
Not me.

407
28:43.284 --> 28:44.317
That's not the point.

408
28:46.456 --> 28:47.490
Were you shocked?

409
28:50.764 --> 28:52.364
You already knew it?

410
28:53.837 --> 28:54.637
Um.

411
29:01.830 --> 29:03.563
But Jeen was right.

412
29:06.116 --> 29:08.137
I shouldn't have waited until she did something wrong.

413
29:10.870 --> 29:12.203
If I don't like her anymore,

414
29:12.770 --> 29:14.670
I should have broken up with her in the first place.

415
29:19.203 --> 29:21.070
No one is entirely at fault.

416
29:22.670 --> 29:26.137
At least everyone has moved on their own path now.

417
29:29.237 --> 29:30.803
Will you stay with me then?

418
29:34.737 --> 29:35.870
I'm not going anywhere.

419
29:38.270 --> 29:39.870
If you want me to stay,

420
29:40.903 --> 29:41.937
I'm happy to stay.

421
29:43.803 --> 29:44.837
Don't go anywhere.

422
29:47.070 --> 29:47.870
Okay.

423
29:53.503 --> 29:54.303
Kids.

424
29:54.803 --> 29:55.237
Yes?

425
29:55.237 --> 29:57.437
The gift-giving activity is about to start inside.

426
29:57.903 --> 29:59.603
Shall we go inside?

427
29:59.903 --> 30:00.403
Okay.

428
30:00.403 --> 30:00.915
Okay.

429
30:00.915 --> 30:01.703
Let's go.

430
30:01.937 --> 30:04.837
Everyone, let's head inside. The activity is about to start.

431
30:07.470 --> 30:08.270
Fuse.

432
30:08.850 --> 30:10.350
Can I ask you a favor?

433
30:15.956 --> 30:17.237
Can you take of this costume?

434
30:20.270 --> 30:23.070
Why? Isn't it cute?

435
30:25.903 --> 30:26.909
It is.

436
30:27.875 --> 30:30.337
But it's too cute. I'm jealous.

437
31:49.040 --> 31:49.793
Oh.

438
31:50.545 --> 31:51.677
How did you get in here?

439
31:51.919 --> 31:52.761
Hey.

440
31:53.369 --> 31:54.737
You once made a spare key for me.

441
31:54.737 --> 31:55.537
Did you forget?

442
31:56.604 --> 31:57.404
Hmm.

443
31:58.570 --> 31:59.804
I'm taking it back.

444
32:01.108 --> 32:02.175
Why didn't you tell me before coming?

445
32:03.082 --> 32:04.382
You can take it back.

446
32:04.393 --> 32:06.093
I'll made ten spare keys instead.

447
32:07.177 --> 32:08.411
Are you crazy?

448
32:10.255 --> 32:11.155
Come here.

449
32:14.149 --> 32:14.949
Come and eat.

450
32:15.293 --> 32:16.259
I've made plenty.

451
32:20.467 --> 32:22.834
I made it myself and I already tried it.

452
32:23.970 --> 32:27.170
Hey, anyone can do that.

453
32:27.935 --> 32:29.242
But my eggs…

454
32:29.683 --> 32:30.663
are exceptionally delicious.

455
32:31.467 --> 32:35.681
Since I do it hard, I mean I put my heart into it.

456
32:37.658 --> 32:38.525
Come on.

457
32:45.675 --> 32:46.909
Let's eat vegetable first.

458
32:48.973 --> 32:49.773
Here.

459
32:58.222 --> 32:59.022
Is it good?

460
33:02.343 --> 33:03.409
Another one?

461
33:43.263 --> 33:45.297
Oh, I made a mess.

462
33:46.073 --> 33:46.873
It's okay.

463
33:50.553 --> 33:51.441
Hold on.

464
33:51.641 --> 33:52.519
Hmm?

465
33:52.604 --> 33:54.471
You're eating without a fork?

466
33:56.423 --> 33:57.223
Oh right.

467
33:58.366 --> 33:59.399
How should I eat it then?

468
35:01.210 --> 35:02.276
I'll check it out.

469
35:02.384 --> 35:03.850
Hold on, don't leave yet.

470
35:04.477 --> 35:06.344
Wait a sec. I'll be right back.

471
35:06.616 --> 35:08.442
Book, just a moment.

472
35:10.282 --> 35:11.115
Wait here.

473
35:44.802 --> 35:49.435
How have you been, Book? Struggling with anything lately?

474
35:51.326 --> 35:52.126
Not at all.

475
35:54.063 --> 35:59.830
Don't you miss me? You’ve never called me.

476
36:14.405 --> 36:15.639
Is that your friend?

477
36:16.163 --> 36:16.963
Yes.

478
36:21.550 --> 36:24.184
I'm happy that you have a friend with you.

479
36:28.563 --> 36:32.663
Well… has your dad called you?

480
36:34.487 --> 36:35.487
Uh, he hasn't.

481
36:56.394 --> 36:57.383
Book…

482
36:58.897 --> 37:00.290
Well…

483
37:03.374 --> 37:04.947
Your dad and I are divorced.

484
37:08.270 --> 37:12.405
I'm sorry I couldn't give you a complete family.

485
37:24.320 --> 37:25.367
It's okay.

486
37:27.330 --> 37:28.650
As long as you're happy,

487
37:30.215 --> 37:31.754
that's already a complete family to me.

488
37:39.394 --> 37:40.505
For me,

489
37:42.137 --> 37:43.755
as long as you still here,

490
37:44.382 --> 37:46.359
I still have my family.

491
37:48.809 --> 37:53.409
I'm happy to see you loving yourself again.

492
37:59.920 --> 38:01.680
I'm sorry, sweetheart.

493
38:04.356 --> 38:06.900
I'll pull myself together.

494
38:07.736 --> 38:10.117
Find a job.

495
38:11.282 --> 38:13.093
And visit you more often. Sound good?

496
38:14.192 --> 38:15.168
Most importantly,

497
38:16.397 --> 38:18.797
let's go on a lot of trips together, okay?

498
38:19.663 --> 38:20.463
Okay.

499
39:06.714 --> 39:08.257
Hello, Fuse.

500
39:08.480 --> 39:10.170
Hello, Yimwan.

501
39:10.523 --> 39:11.850
You look as beautiful as always.

502
39:11.909 --> 39:15.123
You're such a sweet talker.

503
39:15.207 --> 39:16.343
Please have a seat.

504
39:17.247 --> 39:18.047
Thank you.

505
39:18.460 --> 39:19.723
Enjoy your breakfast.

506
39:19.777 --> 39:20.277
Thanks.

507
39:24.576 --> 39:26.576
Annyeonghaseyo.

508
39:27.314 --> 39:30.575
Tee told me you like Korean food.

509
39:30.575 --> 39:33.347
So I told Yimwan to prepare Korean food for you.

510
39:34.363 --> 39:37.196
Oh, okay.

511
39:40.227 --> 39:42.994
Where is Tee by the way?

512
39:43.481 --> 39:47.247
You only asked about him as soon as you arrived. Not even a single word about me.

513
39:47.687 --> 39:49.353
But I really meant to come and see you.

514
39:57.581 --> 40:01.031
Tee is upstairs, probably asleep.

515
40:01.031 --> 40:03.747
Go check on him and bring him down for breakfast.

516
40:04.007 --> 40:04.807
Okay.

517
40:12.260 --> 40:13.293
Tim.

518
40:15.860 --> 40:17.260
Oppa saranghae.

519
40:43.047 --> 40:44.116
Tee.

520
40:47.573 --> 40:49.800
Tee, I'm here.

521
40:50.447 --> 40:51.247
Wake up.

522
40:54.400 --> 40:56.320
What a heavy sleeper.

523
40:59.547 --> 41:00.347
What?

524
41:01.981 --> 41:04.089
Tee, I'm here.

525
41:05.147 --> 41:05.947
Hey.

526
41:11.647 --> 41:12.981
You're heavy.

527
41:34.640 --> 41:38.294
If you're not waking up, I'd better go.

528
41:40.640 --> 41:42.337
Hey, don't leave yet.

529
41:43.675 --> 41:44.729
What’s the rush?

530
41:47.774 --> 41:48.974
Because you weren't waking up.

531
41:50.047 --> 41:51.514
Why didn't you wake me up nicely?

532
41:52.654 --> 41:53.621
What do you mean by "nicely"?

533
41:54.767 --> 41:55.567
Like this.

534
41:56.841 --> 41:58.107
Are you messing with me?

535
41:59.080 --> 42:02.247
If you kiss me, I'll get right up.

536
42:04.047 --> 42:07.381
Get up. Tim is waiting, we'd better go downstairs.

537
42:09.647 --> 42:11.435
You're single now.

538
42:12.381 --> 42:13.881
Can I kiss you, please?

539
42:14.881 --> 42:15.947
You can't.

540
42:18.181 --> 42:19.347
Because your breath smells.

541
42:19.714 --> 42:20.914
Go brush your teeth.

542
42:23.147 --> 42:24.547
Give me three minutes.

543
42:25.247 --> 42:26.347
Wait for me here.

544
42:26.747 --> 42:27.547
Don't go anywhere.

545
42:28.114 --> 42:29.082
I'll be right back.

546
42:29.082 --> 42:29.781
Um.

547
42:34.514 --> 42:35.647
Don't go anywhere.

548
42:36.114 --> 42:36.914
I'll be right back.

549
42:37.014 --> 42:38.443
I know.

550
42:56.881 --> 42:58.281
Tee, your phone.

551
42:58.914 --> 43:00.681
Can you check who it is?

552
43:12.499 --> 43:14.499
(Tee.)

553
43:15.653 --> 43:17.653
(Where are you?)

554
43:18.187 --> 43:20.187
(I really want to see you.)

555
43:20.496 --> 43:21.738
(I can't take it anymore.)

556
43:21.738 --> 43:25.610
(Can you come back to me?)

557
43:51.481 --> 43:52.781
What did you do to my person?

558
43:53.527 --> 43:55.093
You shouldn't be asking me.

559
43:55.647 --> 43:57.114
You should go ask your own person.

560
43:57.301 --> 43:58.507
Why are you sulking?

561
43:58.973 --> 43:59.773
Can you tell me about it?

562
43:59.947 --> 44:01.147
Your ex.

563
44:01.847 --> 44:03.023
She's your friend.

564
44:03.248 --> 44:04.317
I'm also your friend.

565
44:05.013 --> 44:06.380
It's not my place to stop you.

566
44:07.181 --> 44:08.614
Can I ask your advice on something?

567
44:09.100 --> 44:11.631
No matter what happens from now on,

568
44:12.083 --> 44:13.564
I'll never give up.

569
44:13.809 --> 44:15.776
What about you? Can you do it?
